{
  "$comment": "Lazy runtime parts. Build/Sync-Assets.ps1 assembles each into canopyx-<name>.js (and .css), registers it with CanopyX.registerPart, writes the build manifest every entry point reads, and writes canopyx-parts.json, which CanopyX.Html reads to write and embed the parts. Entry points leave out every script a part lists, unless the part lists it under shared too. See docs/plugins.md.",
